    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya mwenye jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya mwanace jwa Ahasi ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Yuda, mcaka catatu ca ucimwene wa Hosheya, mwanace jwa Ela, mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiyawo ŵajinjile ucimwene ali ŵa yaka 25 yakupagwa, nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka 29 ku Yelusalemu. Mama ŵawo ŵaliji Abiya, mwanace jwamkongwe jwa Sakaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵatesile yindu yambone yakumnonyelesya Mlungu, mpela muŵatendele Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ambujegwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapaswile malo gosope gakulambila milungu ja cilendo, ŵagumwile yipilala ya maganga, ŵatemangwile soni yitela yiyaliji pa malo gaŵalambililaga mlungu jwamkongwe, jwakolanjidwa ni lina lyakuti Ashela. Ŵalikasile lijoka lya bulonsi liŵapanganyisye Mose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lila. Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵalipele lijokalyo lina lyakuti Nehushitani, nipo ŵaliji mkulicimbicisya pakulitajila mbopesi ni kulitutumicisya ubani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 21:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paliji pangali jwakulandana ni Hesekiya pasikati pa ayimwene wosope ŵa cilambo ca Yuda, kutandila ŵaŵajinjile m'malo mwakwe jwalakwe ali awile, ni atamose pasikati pa ayimwene ŵaŵapali kala jwalakwe mkanajinjile ucimwene. Ligongo jwalakwejo ŵakulupilile mnope AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵaliji jwakulupicika kwa AMBUJE, nipo ŵagapikanile malamusi giŵagapelece AMBUJE kwa Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ligongo lyakwe AMBUJE ŵamkamucisye jwalakwe, nipo yindu yiliyose yiŵatendaga jwalakwejo yamjendelaga cenene. Hesekiyawo ŵamjimucile mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, nipo ŵakanile kumtumicila soni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵapundile pa kuputa ngondo, kutandila m'misi jajinondi mpakana m'misinda jajikulungwa, ja cilambo ca Filisiti, mpaka ŵajile kwika ku Gasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mcaka ca mcece ca ucimwene wa Hesekiya, cicaliji caka ca msano ni kaŵili ca ucimwene wa Hosheya ku Isalaeli, Shalimanesa mwenye jwa cilambo ca Asiliya ŵalongolele asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo kuja kuputa ngondo ku Samaliya, mcilambo ca Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵawusumwile m'msinda wa Samaliyawo ali amenyene ngondo kwa yaka yitatu. Caliji caka ca msano ni kamo ca ucimwene wa Hesekiya, ni soni caka ca msano ni mcece ca ucimwene wa Hosheya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Asiliya ŵajigele Aisalaeli kuja nawo ku ukapolo ku cilambo ca Asiliya. Ŵatamice Aisalaeli ŵane mu m'msinda wa Hala, ŵane mungulugulu Lusulo lwa Haboli mbali ja Gosani, ni Aisalaeli ŵane m'misinda ja Amedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeleyi yatendekwe ligongo ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli nganagapikanila maloŵe ga AMBUJE Mlungu ŵawo. Ŵakasile cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ciŵapangene AMBUJE ni jemanjajo, pamo ni malamusi gosope gaŵapele Mose. Nganagapikanila malamusigo ni kugatendela masengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Siliya akuputa ngondo ku Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mcaka ca 14 ca ucimwene wa Hesekiya ku Yuda, Senakelibu mwenye jwa ku Asiliya ŵalongolele asilikali ŵakwe kuja kuputa ngondo ku misinda jaliji mkati mwa mapupa ga ku Yuda, nipo ŵajisumwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ŵatumisye maloŵe ku Lakishi kwa Mwenye Senakelibu, gakuti, “Ngumanyilila kuti une ndemwisye pakwajimucila ŵalakwe. Conde ngwaŵenda kuti akapitilisya kumenyana ni uneji, andece. Nipo une tindipile cilicose citasalile ŵalakwe kuti ndipile.” Myoyo Mwenye Senakelibu ŵamlamwile Hesekiya kuti apelece kwa jwalakwe makilogalamu 10,000 ga silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni makilogalamu 1,000 ga golidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Hesekiya ŵapelece kwa mwenyejo silifa josope jwa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, pamo ni jwa ku nyumba jakusunjila cipanje ca mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵagumwile soni golidi juŵaliji pa matanga ga Nyumba ja AMBUJE ni golidi josope juŵagumbile jwalakweju msyene pa mafelemu ga matanga, nipo ŵampelece golidi josopejo kwa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mwenye jwa ku Asiliya jula ŵalamwile acakulungwa ŵa ngondo ŵatatu, kuti atyoce ku msinda wa Lakishi ni kulilongolela likuga lyekulungwa lya asilikali kuja kuputa ngondo ku Yelusalemu. Piŵajinjile mu msindamo, acakulungwa ŵa ngondo ŵala ŵajimi pa msewo wakwinjilila kumalo ga mundu jwine jwa kupanganya nguwo, msewo welewu waliji mungulugulu ngalande ja mesi jakutyocela kwitanda lya kumkuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwa ŵa ngondo ŵala ŵamŵilasile Mwenye Hesekiya, nipo nduna syakwe sitatu syakopwece mu msindamo kuja kuwonegana nawo. Jumo jwa ndunasyo ŵaliji Eliyakimu mwanace jwa Hilikiya, juŵaliji nduna jajikulungwa. Shebina, juŵaliji mlembela jwa panganya ja mwenye, ni Yowa mwanace jwa Asafu, juŵaliji jwakusunga mabuku ga boma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jumo jwa acakulungwa wa asilikali ŵa ku Asiliya ŵasalile jemanjajo kuti mkamsalile Mwenye Hesekiya kuti, mwenye jwamkulungwa, mwenye jwa ku Asiliya akumwusya kuti ana cikumlimbisya cikulupi cenu camti myiyi ni cici? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ana mkuganicisya kuti mpaka mpunde pa ngondo ni maloŵepe, pangali yida? Ana sambano mkwakulupilila ŵani kuti tamkamucisye pa ngondo pamkunjimucila unejipa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapena mkwembeceya kuti Iguputo tamkamucisye eti? Nambo kutenda myoyo kuli mpela kulikulupilila litete lyetemece, lyele likomboleka kumtota mundu mwigasa lyakwe ali alitesile simbo jakwendela. Ni mwele Mwenye jwa ku Iguputo akusamtendela jwalijose jwa kuŵika cikulupi mwa jwalakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jumo jwa acakulungwa ŵa asilikali ŵa ku Asiliya jula ŵatite soni kuti, “Ana kapena timusalile kuti sambano mkwakulupilila AMBUJE Mlungu ŵenu? Ana ngaŵa Mlungu jwakwe jujojo jwele Hesekiya ŵapaswile malo gakwe gakulambila, ni malo gakwe gagakupelecela mbopesi? Ŵasalile soni ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ni ŵa ku Yelusalemu kuti ŵalambileje AMBUJE pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi ga ku Yelusalemu basi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwende sambano tupangane m'mwejo ni une mu lina lya ambuje ŵangu, mwenye jwa ku Asiliya. Tinampe mahaci gakwanila 2,000, tulole naga m'mwejo timpakombole kwapata ŵandu ŵakwela gele mahacigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana mpaka mumpunde uli msilikali jumo jwa udindo wawunandi jwa ku Asiliya, pakuŵa mkwakulupilila ŵa Iguputo, kuti ampe mageleta ni ŵandu ŵakwela pa mahaci? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana mwine ngamkumanyilila kuti AMBUJE ni ŵandumisye une akuno, kuti mbute ngondo mcilambo acino ni kucijonanga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliyakimu, Shebina ni Yowa ŵamsalile jwamkulungwa jwa asilikaliwo kuti, “Pepani bwana, tukwaŵenda aŵecete kwetuwe mciŵeceto ca ci Alemaiki, pakuŵa tukusapikanaga. Akusatuŵecetela mciŵeceto ca Ayuda, pakuŵa ŵandu wosope ŵali pa mlangoŵa akuyipikana yosope yakuŵecetayo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali jula ŵajanjile kuti, “Ana mkuganicisya kuti mwenye jwangu ŵandumile kuti mbecete gele maloŵega kwa jemanjape pamo ni mwenye ŵenu peŵa basi? Iyayi, nguŵeceta soni kwa ŵandu ŵali pa mlangowo, ŵeleŵa tacilya yakusakala yakopoka mcilu mwawo ni kumwa makweso gawo, mpela mutimcitendela jemanja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali jula ŵajimi ni ŵagumisile m'Ciyuda acitiji kuti, “Pikanani maloŵe gakuŵeceta mwenye jwamkulungwa jwa ku Asiliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo akuti, mkakunda kuti Hesekiya amnyenje jemanja, ligongo ngapakombola kumkulupusya m'magasa mwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkakunda kuti amlambusye jemanja kuti mwakulupilile AMBUJE kuti tamkulupusye, ni soni kuti mwenye jwa ku Asiliya ngasumula msinda wenuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkampikanila Hesekiya. Mwenye jwa ku Asiliya akumlamula jemanja kuti mkopoce mu msindamo ni mlipelece mwacimsyene m'magasa mwa jwalakwejo. Naga mkutenda myoyo, mwenyewo tacimleka jwalijose kuti alyeje mipeleya ni nguju syakwe ni kumwa mesi ga mcisima cakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mpaka pa ndaŵi jitacimjigala jemanja mwenye jwa ku Asiliyajo kwawula namwe ku cilambo cakulandana ni cilambo cenu cino, cilambo cana cajila ni yakulya yejinji. Naga mkupikanila yakumsalila mwenye jwa ku Asiliyajo, timtame ni umi, ngim'wa. Myoyo jemanja mkalamuce, Hesekiya akamloŵesya pakumsalila kuti AMBUJE tamkulupusye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana jipali milungu ja ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jijakulupwisye ŵandu ŵa mcilambo mwakwe kwa mwenye jwa kwa Asiliya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana milungu ja Hamati ni Alipadi yawonecele yicici? Nambi milungu ja Sefalafayimu, Hena, ni Ifa jili kwapi? Ana milungu jeleji jakulupwisye msinda ŵa Samaliya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana cakaci milungu jeleji ja yilambo yeleyi, jakulupwisye yilambo yawo kutyocela kwa mwenye jwetu jwa kwa Asiliya, kuti jemanja mjileje kuti AMBUJE tawukulupusye msinda ŵa Yelusalemu kwa mwenye jwetujo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵandu ŵagambile kutama jii, ngajanga kandu mpela muŵasalilile Mwenye Hesekiya, kuti akajanga kandu kalikose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Eliyakimu, Shebina, ni Yowa ŵapapwile yakuwala yawo mwacanasa, nipo ŵajawile kwa Mwenye Hesekiya ni ŵamsalile yosope yiŵaŵecete jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali jwa ku Asiliya jula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
